---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Refunds — DiskPrune"
  description="DiskPrune is a one-time license. Email support@diskprune.com within 14 days for a Stripe refund. The license is then revoked."
>
  <main class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Refunds</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      DiskPrune is a one-time license. If it is not useful on your Mac, email
      <a href="mailto:support@diskprune.com">support@diskprune.com</a>
      within 14 days of purchase and we will refund the Stripe charge.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      After a refund the license is revoked. Further activations are refused. Already-issued
      tokens expire on their own (up to 90 days); do not keep using the product after a refund.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Chargebacks without contacting us first may revoke the license immediately.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
